{"name":"Painted Skies","hex":"#b28774","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"painted","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of paint"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Coated with paint.","Depicted in paint."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/painted"},{"term":"skies","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of sky though essentially synonymous with singular form; the heavens; the firmament; the atmosphere.","plural of skie."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["third-person singular simple present indicative of sky"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/skies"}],"entries":[{"title":"Paint","blocks":[{"text":"Paint is a material or mixture of colored liquid that, when applied to a solid material and allowed to dry, adds a film-like layer. As art, this is used to create an image or images known as a painting. Paint can be made in many colors and types. Most paints are either oil-based or water-based, and each has distinct characteristics."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Multicolored_tempera_paints.jpg/330px-Multicolored_tempera_paints.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paint","wikidata":"Q174219"},{"title":"Sky","blocks":[{"text":"The sky is an unobstructed view upward from the surface of the Earth. It includes the atmosphere and outer space. It may also be considered a place between the ground and outer space, thus distinct from outer space."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/July_night_sky_%2835972569256%29.jpg/330px-July_night_sky_%2835972569256%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sky","wikidata":"Q527"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Lascaux%2C_Megaloceros.jpg/500px-Lascaux%2C_Megaloceros.jpg?utm_so